; --- Kettle: the closes round the town --------------------------------------

; The town's own ground outside its door: garden closes and kitchen
; plots behind the terraces, kale, leeks and onions in them, hedges
; black with the town's soot, the washing out on them, a flagged causey
; to the town's door.

